{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>My eye will not return</b> — after my death." "<b>And the word זכור</b> — speaks of place. So too כי תשים עלי משמר — its meaning is the watch of the sea, like the sense of בל ישובון לכסות הארץ."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {1 "The analogy hinges on משמר as a watch/guard-post; the specific intertextual logic is compressed and left as Ibn Ezra gives it."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:02:03.323155851Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}